---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';

const title = 'Stripchat vs LiveJasmin: Public Rooms vs Premium Interaction';
const description = 'Compare Stripchat and LiveJasmin by access model, paid interaction style, discovery flow and who each experience may suit.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pageType="Article">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/live-cams">Live Cams</a><span>/</span><span>Stripchat vs LiveJasmin</span></nav>
      <span class="kicker">High-intent comparison · September 2026</span>
      <h1>Stripchat vs LiveJasmin</h1>
      <p class="lead">The main difference is not “which brand is bigger.” It is whether you want broad public-room discovery first, or a more premium/private-interaction-oriented experience.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <AffiliateButton source="stripchat_vs_livejasmin_hero" />
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/stripchat">Read Stripchat review</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell narrow">
    <table class="comparison-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Factor</th><th>Stripchat</th><th>LiveJasmin</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Discovery style</strong></td><td>Public-room-first browsing.</td><td>More premium/private-interaction-oriented positioning.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Paid model</strong></td><td>Token-based tips and paid interactions.</td><td>Credit-based paid interaction.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Best fit</strong></td><td>Users who want to explore broadly before spending.</td><td>Users comparing a more premium-style experience.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Try now from StripUnion</strong></td><td>Yes.</td><td>Compare on StripUnion.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <section class="conversion-strip">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Next step</span>
        <h2>Prefer the public-room model?</h2>
        <p>If the comparison points you toward broad discovery with optional token spending, you can open Stripchat directly from StripUnion.</p>
      </div>
      <AffiliateButton source="stripchat_vs_livejasmin_mid" />
    </section>

    <section class="article-body">
      <section><h2>Choose by interaction model</h2><p>Stripchat is easier to frame as “browse first, spend later,” while LiveJasmin is better understood as a more premium/private-interaction-oriented model. That distinction is more useful than a generic winner label.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Think about how you control spend</h2><p>Tokens and credits both create incremental spending rather than one simple all-access price. The practical question is how quickly you expect to move from browsing into paid interaction.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Why StripUnion keeps the LiveJasmin research on-site</h2><p>LiveJasmin search intent can still bring valuable users to StripUnion. Until we have an approved LiveJasmin affiliate relationship, those users should compare here and move to a monetizable Stripchat route if that model suits them.</p></section>
    </section>

    <section class="end-cta">
      <div><span class="kicker">Try it now</span><h2>Ready to try Stripchat?</h2><p>Open Stripchat if it is the model you prefer after comparing.</p></div>
      <AffiliateButton source="stripchat_vs_livejasmin_bottom" />
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
